    <string name="privacy_policy_header">Janta Nivesh Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_intro">At Janta Nivesh (a product under Velvet Investing) (“Janta Nivesh”, “we”, “our”, “us”), we value your trust and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and safeguard your information when you use our website, mobile application, and related services.</string>
